# History
# ~~~~~~~
# 10/06/2016    Tim Wilcox      V03.05.00   T0662   original release
# 09/09/2016    Tim Wilcox      V03.05.01   T2229   dont show lines with "~" as pick list number
# 12/04/2017    Tim Wilcox      V03.05.02   T----   all functions moved to XMOXM5MQ
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Version Control
# ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Funprog VERTEST() : End "03.05.02 12/04/2017 XM5"
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

################################################################################
## Main Process
## ~~~~~~~~~~~~
##
##  Called for each ACTION.
##  In here we call additional processing for specific ACTION codes.
##  V03.05.01, added FILTRE actiont
##  v03.05.02, call function from XMOXM5MQ
################################################################################
$ACTION

    If func AFNC.ACTIV("XM5")
        Gosub ACTION From XMOXM5MQ
    Endif

Return

